<title>GREECE: GREEK 1997 BUDGET SUBMITTED TO PARLIAMENT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1997 BUDGET SUBMITTED TO PARLIAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's National Economy and Finance Minister Yannos Papandoniou submitted his 1997 budget to parliament on Friday and then left for a news conference to hand out the document to journalists and answer questions, parliament officials said. --Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
